|i_<Down>|	<Down>		cursor one line down
|i_<S-Down>|	<S-Down>	same as <PageDown>
|i_<Home>|	<Home>		cursor to start of line
|i_<C-Home>|	<C-Home>	cursor to start of file
|i_<End>|	<End>		cursor past end of line
