|<S-ScrollWheelLeft>|	<S-ScrollWheelLeft>	move window one page left
|<ScrollWheelRight>|	<ScrollWheelRight>	move window six columns right
|<S-ScrollWheelRight>|	<S-ScrollWheelRight>	move window one page right

